{"id":"wb-4-168","name":"祆神楼","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T11:54:03+00:00","status":"ready","title":"祆神楼","text":"祆神楼位于中国山西省晋中介休市城内，是一座门楼，乐楼与过街楼相结合的楼阁式建筑，1996年被列为第四批全国重点文物保护单位。祆神楼为中华人民共和国目前唯一仅存的祆教建筑，作为三结义庙前的乐楼，同时也作为过街楼。","shortened":false,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E7%A5%86%E7%A5%9E%E6%A5%BC","revisionId":93663831,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=93663831","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"名称与地理坐标一致","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/ef73df9b463f548b7715d5df.jpg","title":"介休祆神楼.jpg","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:%E4%BB%8B%E4%BC%91%E7%A5%86%E7%A5%9E%E6%A5%BC.jpg","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/e/ec/%E4%BB%8B%E4%BC%91%E7%A5%86%E7%A5%9E%E6%A5%BC.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"Patrick20242023","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0","caption":"介休祆神楼","width":320,"height":240}}